          ]
        },
        "202470036": {
          "id": 202470036,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "紅色還是藍色",
          "next": [
            202470037,
            202470038,
            202470039
          ]
        },
        "202470037": {
          "id": 202470037,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "紅色！",
          "next": [
            202470040
          ]
        },
        "202470038": {
          "id": 202470038,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "藍色！",
          "next": [
            202470040
          ]
        },
        "202470039": {
          "id": 202470039,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "毀滅吧！我出剪刀！",
          "next": [
            202470041
          ]
        },
        "202470040": {
          "id": 202470040,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "心有靈犀",
          "next": [
            202470043
          ]
        },
        "202470041": {
          "id": 202470041,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "我就猜到你不會按牌理出牌，不過這局只有兩個選擇",
          "next": [
            202470042
          ]
        },
        "202470042": {
          "id": 202470042,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "我替你隨便選一個吧，相信我們心有靈犀",
          "next": [
            202470043
          ]
        },
        "202470043": {
          "id": 202470043,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "你又在賭什麼",
          "next": [
            202470044
          ]
        },
        "202470044": {
          "id": 202470044,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "有個小孩在我的遮陽傘旁邊轉好幾圈了",
          "next": [
            202470045
          ]
        },
        "202470045": {
          "id": 202470045,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "我以為他迷路了，沒想到是看中了我腳下的沙子",
          "next": [
            202470046
          ]
        },
        "202470046": {
          "id": 202470046,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "說我這裡是全海灘最細的沙子，只有這種沙子才能建出最堅固的沙堡",
          "next": [
            202470047
          ]
        },
        "202470047": {
          "id": 202470047,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "不過小朋友滿有趣，沒要求我直接走",
          "next": [
            202470048
          ]
        },
        "202470048": {
          "id": 202470048,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "他想打賭：眼前一紅一藍的寄居蟹，哪隻先衝線",
          "next": [
            202470049
          ]
        },
        "202470049": {
          "id": 202470049,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "他贏了，這片完美的沙地就歸他",
          "next": [
            202470050,
            202470051
          ]
        },
        "202470050": {
          "id": 202470050,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "那你不是逢賭必應，不怕欺負小孩嗎？",
          "next": [
            202470053
          ]
        },
        "202470051": {
          "id": 202470051,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "難怪你來問我，你來賭就完全沒懸念",
          "next": [
            202470052
          ]
        },
        "202470052": {
          "id": 202470052,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "那要是我們贏了呢？",
          "next": [
            202470054
          ]
        },
        "202470053": {
          "id": 202470053,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "所以，請你來押注了",
          "next": [
            202470054
          ]
        },
        "202470054": {
          "id": 202470054,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "對方正在輸入中",
          "next": [
            202470055
          ]
        },
        "202470055": {
          "id": 202470055,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "稍等，那隻螃蟹快衝線了",
          "next": [
            202470056
          ]
        },
        "202470056": {
          "id": 202470056,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "我們贏了",
          "next": [
            202470057
          ]
        },
        "202470057": {
          "id": 202470057,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "對方正在輸入中",
          "next": [
            202470068
          ]
        },
        "202470058": {
          "id": 202470058,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "自己的零食？",
          "next": [
            202470060
          ]
        },
        "202470059": {
          "id": 202470059,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "建築沙堡的塑膠鏟子？",
          "next": [
            202470060
          ]
        },
        "202470060": {
          "id": 202470060,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "一枚戒指",
          "next": [
            202470061
          ]
        },
        "202470061": {
          "id": 202470061,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "小孩說大人不需要塑膠鏟子和零食，但賭注不對等，博弈就不公平",
          "next": [
            202470062
          ]
        },
        "202470062": {
          "id": 202470062,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "所以，他給我一只能吃掉噩夢的魔法戒指",
          "next": [
            202470063
          ]
        },
        "202470063": {
          "id": 202470063,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "真可愛，這可是絕版珍品，我正好需要",
          "next": [
            202470064
          ]
        },
        "202470064": {
          "id": 202470064,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "嗯，我決定給他買一杯豪華九筒冰淇淋",
          "next": [
            202470065
          ]
        },
        "202470065": {
          "id": 202470065,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "然後邀請他合法入股沙堡王國的建設",
          "next": [
            202470066
          ]
        },
        "202470066": {
          "id": 202470066,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "next": [
            202470067
          ]
        },
        "202470067": {
          "id": 202470067,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "回見，朋友，我們去搬沙子了",
          "next": []
        },
        "202470068": {
          "id": 202470068,
